    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="II Ew. 1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> II Ew. 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be fryþe.] [Ld] Eadweard cyning myngode his wytan, þa hy æt Exanceastre wæron, þæt hy smeadon ealle, hu heora frið betere beon mæhte, þonne hit ær ðæm wæs; forðam him þuhte, þæt hit mæctor gelæst wære, þonne hit scolde, þæt he ær beboden hæfde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">King Edward exhorted all his councillors, when they were at Exeter, to consider how the public peace for which they were responsible could be kept better than it had been, because it seemed to him that the previous orders had not been carried out so well as they ought to have been.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eadweard cyning mid his witan, ða hy æt Exceastre wæron, smeadon ealle, hu heora frið betere beon mehte, ðone hit ær ðæm wæs; forðam him ðuhte, þæt hit mæctor gelæst wære, ðonne hit scolde, þæt he ær beboden hæfde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
